      en: ["About 75,000 inhabitants in Ash Sharqiyah North", "About 200 kilometers southeast of Muscat", "Transitional zone between the Hajar Mountains and Wahiba", "Archaeological finds from over 3,000 years", "Extensive date palm plantations", "Aflaj irrigation system a UNESCO World Heritage site since 2006", "Historic villages of Sinaw and Samad ash-Shan", "Numerous forts and watchtowers"]
